# Synthetic script, independent of the disassembly's desynchronizing TAS movies.
# Decimal repeat count, hexadecimal pad 1 byte, optional hexadecimal pad 2.
# Bits: A=01 B=02 Select=04 Start=08 Up=10 Down=20 Left=40 Right=80.
1200 00          # title idle, then attract demo
1 08             # leave attract for Selection A track selection
60 00
1 08             # choose Track 1
550 00           # interstitial and start lights
400 01           # throttle into race
